cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "scbinder — Earthworm's binder_ew associator as a SeisComP module"
message: "If you use scbinder in work that leads to a publication, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Mustafa
    family-names: Çomoğlu
    affiliation: Geoscience Australia
    email: comoglu@gmail.com
abstract: >-
  scbinder is a port of Earthworm's phase associator binder_ew (Carl
  Johnson's grid-stacking nucleation plus L1-norm relocation) to SeisComP.
  The Earthworm algorithm core is bundled verbatim under its MIT license;
  the SeisComP Client::Application adapter, offline playback mode,
  travel-time backend dispatch and regression harness are original work
  under AGPL-3.0-or-later.
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: ""
references:
  - type: software
    title: "Earthworm binder_ew"
    notes: >-
      Original associator, version 1.0.43 (2024-11-02), bundled verbatim
      in core/ and ewlib/. MIT license, Copyright (c) 2022 Seismic
      Software; algorithm by Carl Johnson and the Earthworm community.
    authors:
      - name: "Carl Johnson and the Earthworm community"
